---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SRC, OFFICIAL, u } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="Sources and rules" description="How Doomsday Dossier sources every fact, and what it will never publish." page="about">
  <section class="ab">
    <div class="wrap ab-inner">
      <p class="label" data-hero-in>Sources and rules</p>
      <h1 class="display ab-title" data-split="words" data-split-on="load">Nothing here is a guess.</h1>
      <div class="ab-cols">
        <div>
          <h2 class="serif">The rules</h2>
          <ol>
            <li>Every fact about Avengers: Doomsday comes from a Marvel announcement, listed below.</li>
            <li>A page says an actor plays a named character only where Marvel has named that role. Otherwise it says the role is not yet named.</li>
            <li>Character history comes from the Marvel Fandom wiki, the Marvel Cinematic Universe Wiki and the named films and comics. Every section lists its sources.</li>
            <li>All writing is our own. Nothing is copied from the wikis.</li>
            <li>No rumours, leaks, set reports or plot predictions. People who asked on stage to join the cast, but whom Marvel has not confirmed, are left out.</li>
            <li>Each dossier shows three photos of the character. Images belong to their respective owners, are used here non-commercially, and any image will be removed on request. Every one is listed on the <a href={u('/credits/')}>image credits</a> page. All other visuals are made from colour, type and code.</li>
          </ol>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="serif">Marvel sources for the film</h2>
          <ol class="ab-src">
            {Object.values(SRC).map((s) => <li><a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{s.label}</a></li>)}
          </ol>
          <p class="ab-note">Facts last checked {OFFICIAL.verifiedOn}.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="ab-legal">
        <h2 class="serif">Unofficial</h2>
        <p>Doomsday Dossier is an unofficial, non-commercial fan project. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by Marvel, Marvel Studios or The Walt Disney Company. All character names, related marks and images are the property of their owners.</p>
        <p>Fan votes in the fight arena are opinions, not facts, and are labelled that way. Voting uses Cloudflare Turnstile to keep bots out. The site stores no account, name, email or IP address: a vote is counted once per fight per day using a code that changes daily and cannot be traced back to you.</p>
        <p>Motion is built with GSAP, ScrollTrigger, Lenis and Three.js. Reduced-motion settings are respected: with them on, every page is still and fully readable.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .ab { padding: calc(var(--header-h) + 80px) 0 100px; }
  .ab-inner { display: grid; gap: 40px; }
  .ab-title { font-size: clamp(54px, 10vw, 160px); }
  .ab-cols { display: grid; gap: 48px; }
  @media (min-width: 900px) { .ab-cols { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  h2.serif { font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 42px); margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .ab ol { padding-left: 22px; color: var(--bone-dim); }
  .ab li { margin: 10px 0; }
  .ab-src a { color: var(--bone); text-decoration-color: var(--doom); text-underline-offset: 3px; word-break: break-word; }
  .ab-note { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--bone-dim); }
  .ab-legal { max-width: 70ch; color: var(--bone-dim); border-top: 1px solid var(--iron-2); padding-top: 30px; }
</style>
